BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:samos-kokkari-two-night-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kokkari-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270728
SUMMARY:Two-night panigiri of Agios Panteleimon\, Kokkari
LOCATION:Kokkari\, Samos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kokkari's summer festival on 26 and 27 July\, run by the 'Aristarchos' association with the local council: two live orchestras on successive nights (from 20:30 at the central car park by the harbour)\, local dance groups\, free entry\, food and drink from stalls. The seaside village also holds a smaller Agios Fanourios panigiri on 26 August. Stay in Kokkari or take the last bus back to Vathy.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samos/#kokkari-two-night-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kokkari
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/samos/#kokkari-two-night-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-kokkari
END:VEVENT
